{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Validate execution existence before creating a worker**\n\nSyntax validation allows an unknown ARN into `_registry.submit`. The default memory store then exposes a raw `KeyError` while disk stores return a different exception, and the failed task leaves a worker lane registered for the nonexistent execution. Call `get_execution()` before submitting in both pause and resume, returning a consistent `ResourceNotFoundException`, and add unknown-ARN tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM76dgH0","finding_digest":"b06883edb6b92ca6edc8811e6a57457e9bb9ae91f04fe045182fdb6e7bcc9f63","finding_id":"arf_v1_wbuih3nwxewkn3oiqepguv2fp2","finding_key":"testing/executor.py::pause-resume::unknown-execution-worker-leak","identity_key":"testing/executor.py::pause-resume::unknown-execution-worker-leak","line":1818,"observation_digest":"9f0d2293cd97dc8a7cca3cca18b803184c5de28a9b6d57faeefc534196ff726c","observation_id":"aro_v1_t4gsfe6ns7oiu7gkhtfbroaddb","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_testing/executor.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-07T01:09:22Z","review_id":"arr_v1_opc5zt7jzz33ear4h4i6yh76s3","reviewed_base_sha":"55659db79c158d3623800f6f40755de01b0e057f","reviewed_head_sha":"88dffdcbbd44c24219bc5f2cbde9581e44e1589b","reviewer":"codex","start_line":1814,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":757},"record_id":"art_v1_wkes7uwumj7yk3mwytwv62dos2","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T01:09:22Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
